! Mini Room: only the data of the input document (building.txt) are marked as such; everything else is an EnergyPlus requirement or an assumption.
! A teaching example of BEMGenBench, not a benchmark case.

  Version,
    23.1;                         !- Version Identifier  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.

  Building,
    Mini Room,                    !- Name  Source: building.txt (title).
    0,                            !- North Axis  Not in the documents: assumption.
    City;                         !- Terrain  Not in the documents: assumption.

  SimulationControl,
    No,                           !- Do Zone Sizing Calculation  Not in the documents: the ideal loads need no sizing.
    No,                           !- Do System Sizing Calculation  Not in the documents: the ideal loads need no sizing.
    No,                           !- Do Plant Sizing Calculation  Not in the documents: the ideal loads need no sizing.
    No,                           !- Run Simulation for Sizing Periods  Not in the documents: assumption.
    Yes;                          !- Run Simulation for Weather File Run Periods  Not in the documents: assumption.

  Timestep,
    4;                            !- Number of Timesteps per Hour  Not in the documents: assumption.

  Site:Location,
    Tucson,                       !- Name  Source: building.txt, Site.
    32.17,                        !- Latitude  Source: building.txt, Site.
    -110.88,                      !- Longitude  Source: building.txt, Site.
    -7,                           !- Time Zone  Source: building.txt, Site.
    824;                          !- Elevation  Source: building.txt, Site.

  RunPeriod,
    Annual,                       !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    1,                            !- Begin Month  Source: building.txt, Site (whole year).
    1,                            !- Begin Day of Month  Source: building.txt, Site (whole year).
    2025,                         !- Begin Year  Source: building.txt, Site (year 2025).
    12,                           !- End Month  Source: building.txt, Site (whole year).
    31,                           !- End Day of Month  Source: building.txt, Site (whole year).
    2025;                         !- End Year  Source: building.txt, Site (year 2025).

  GlobalGeometryRules,
    UpperLeftCorner,              !- Starting Vertex Position  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    Counterclockwise,             !- Vertex Entry Direction  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    Relative;                     !- Coordinate System  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.

  ScheduleTypeLimits,
    Fraction,                     !- Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    0,                            !- Lower Limit Value  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    1,                            !- Upper Limit Value  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    Continuous;                   !- Numeric Type  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.

  ScheduleTypeLimits,
    Any Number;                   !- Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.

  Schedule:Compact,
    Lights Schedule,              !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Fraction,                     !- Schedule Type Limits Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    Through: 12/31,               !- Field 1
    For: Weekdays,                !- Field 2
    Until: 08:00,                 !- Field 3
    0,                            !- Field 4  Source: building.txt, Internal loads (off before 8:00).
    Until: 18:00,                 !- Field 5
    1,                            !- Field 6  Source: building.txt, Internal loads (on from 8:00 to 18:00).
    Until: 24:00,                 !- Field 7
    0,                            !- Field 8  Source: building.txt, Internal loads (off after 18:00).
    For: AllOtherDays,            !- Field 9
    Until: 24:00,                 !- Field 10
    0;                            !- Field 11  Source: building.txt, Internal loads (off at weekends).

  Schedule:Constant,
    Equipment Schedule,           !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Fraction,                     !- Schedule Type Limits Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    1;                            !- Hourly Value  Source: building.txt, Internal loads (full power all the time).

  Schedule:Constant,
    Heating Setpoint Schedule,    !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Any Number,                   !- Schedule Type Limits Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    21;                           !- Hourly Value  Source: building.txt, Heating and cooling (heating setpoint 21 C).

  Schedule:Constant,
    Cooling Setpoint Schedule,    !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Any Number,                   !- Schedule Type Limits Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    24;                           !- Hourly Value  Source: building.txt, Heating and cooling (cooling setpoint 24 C).

  Schedule:Constant,
    Thermostat Control Type,      !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Any Number,                   !- Schedule Type Limits Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    4;                            !- Hourly Value  Not in the documents: 4 = dual setpoint, chosen to hold both setpoints.

  Material,
    Brick 200mm,                  !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    MediumRough,                  !- Roughness  Not in the documents: assumption.
    0.2,                          !- Thickness  Source: building.txt, Envelope (200 mm).
    0.9,                          !- Conductivity  Source: building.txt, Envelope.
    1800,                         !- Density  Source: building.txt, Envelope.
    900;                          !- Specific Heat  Source: building.txt, Envelope.

  Construction,
    Envelope Construction,        !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Brick 200mm;                  !- Outside Layer  Source: building.txt, Envelope (one layer of brick).

  Zone,
    Office,                       !- Name  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    0,                            !- Direction of Relative North  Not in the documents: assumption.
    0,                            !- X Origin  Not in the documents: the origin is chosen.
    0,                            !- Y Origin  Not in the documents: the origin is chosen.
    0,                            !- Z Origin  Not in the documents: the origin is chosen.
    1,                            !- Type  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    1,                            !- Multiplier  Not in the documents: assumption.
    3;                            !- Ceiling Height  Source: building.txt, Geometry (3 m high).

  BuildingSurface:Detailed,
    Floor,                        !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Floor,                        !- Surface Type  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    Envelope Construction,        !- Construction Name  Source: building.txt, Envelope.
    Office,                       !- Zone Name  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    ,                             !- Space Name
    Ground,                       !- Outside Boundary Condition  Source: building.txt, Geometry (the floor is on the ground).
    ,                             !- Outside Boundary Condition Object
    NoSun,                        !- Sun Exposure  Not in the documents: follows from the ground.
    NoWind,                       !- Wind Exposure  Not in the documents: follows from the ground.
    AutoCalculate,                !- View Factor to Ground  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus default.
    4,                            !- Number of Vertices  Source: building.txt, Geometry (a rectangle).
    0, 0, 0,                      !- Vertex 1  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 5 m).
    0, 5, 0,                      !- Vertex 2  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 5 m).
    10, 5, 0,                     !- Vertex 3  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 5 m).
    10, 0, 0;                     !- Vertex 4  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 5 m).

  BuildingSurface:Detailed,
    Roof,                         !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Roof,                         !- Surface Type  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    Envelope Construction,        !- Construction Name  Source: building.txt, Envelope.
    Office,                       !- Zone Name  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    ,                             !- Space Name
    Outdoors,                     !- Outside Boundary Condition  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    ,                             !- Outside Boundary Condition Object
    SunExposed,                   !- Sun Exposure  Not in the documents: follows from the outdoors.
    WindExposed,                  !- Wind Exposure  Not in the documents: follows from the outdoors.
    AutoCalculate,                !- View Factor to Ground  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus default.
    4,                            !- Number of Vertices  Source: building.txt, Geometry (a rectangle).
    0, 0, 3,                      !- Vertex 1  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 5 m x 3 m).
    10, 0, 3,                     !- Vertex 2  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 5 m x 3 m).
    10, 5, 3,                     !- Vertex 3  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 5 m x 3 m).
    0, 5, 3;                      !- Vertex 4  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 5 m x 3 m).

  BuildingSurface:Detailed,
    South Wall,                   !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Wall,                         !- Surface Type  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    Envelope Construction,        !- Construction Name  Source: building.txt, Envelope.
    Office,                       !- Zone Name  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    ,                             !- Space Name
    Outdoors,                     !- Outside Boundary Condition  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    ,                             !- Outside Boundary Condition Object
    SunExposed,                   !- Sun Exposure  Not in the documents: follows from the outdoors.
    WindExposed,                  !- Wind Exposure  Not in the documents: follows from the outdoors.
    AutoCalculate,                !- View Factor to Ground  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus default.
    4,                            !- Number of Vertices  Source: building.txt, Geometry (a rectangle).
    0, 0, 3,                      !- Vertex 1  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 3 m).
    0, 0, 0,                      !- Vertex 2  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 3 m).
    10, 0, 0,                     !- Vertex 3  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 3 m).
    10, 0, 3;                     !- Vertex 4  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 3 m).

  BuildingSurface:Detailed,
    East Wall,                    !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Wall,                         !- Surface Type  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    Envelope Construction,        !- Construction Name  Source: building.txt, Envelope.
    Office,                       !- Zone Name  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    ,                             !- Space Name
    Outdoors,                     !- Outside Boundary Condition  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    ,                             !- Outside Boundary Condition Object
    SunExposed,                   !- Sun Exposure  Not in the documents: follows from the outdoors.
    WindExposed,                  !- Wind Exposure  Not in the documents: follows from the outdoors.
    AutoCalculate,                !- View Factor to Ground  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus default.
    4,                            !- Number of Vertices  Source: building.txt, Geometry (a rectangle).
    10, 0, 3,                     !- Vertex 1  Source: building.txt, Geometry (5 m x 3 m).
    10, 0, 0,                     !- Vertex 2  Source: building.txt, Geometry (5 m x 3 m).
    10, 5, 0,                     !- Vertex 3  Source: building.txt, Geometry (5 m x 3 m).
    10, 5, 3;                     !- Vertex 4  Source: building.txt, Geometry (5 m x 3 m).

  BuildingSurface:Detailed,
    North Wall,                   !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Wall,                         !- Surface Type  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    Envelope Construction,        !- Construction Name  Source: building.txt, Envelope.
    Office,                       !- Zone Name  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    ,                             !- Space Name
    Outdoors,                     !- Outside Boundary Condition  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    ,                             !- Outside Boundary Condition Object
    SunExposed,                   !- Sun Exposure  Not in the documents: follows from the outdoors.
    WindExposed,                  !- Wind Exposure  Not in the documents: follows from the outdoors.
    AutoCalculate,                !- View Factor to Ground  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus default.
    4,                            !- Number of Vertices  Source: building.txt, Geometry (a rectangle).
    10, 5, 3,                     !- Vertex 1  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 3 m).
    10, 5, 0,                     !- Vertex 2  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 3 m).
    0, 5, 0,                      !- Vertex 3  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 3 m).
    0, 5, 3;                      !- Vertex 4  Source: building.txt, Geometry (10 m x 3 m).

  BuildingSurface:Detailed,
    West Wall,                    !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Wall,                         !- Surface Type  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    Envelope Construction,        !- Construction Name  Source: building.txt, Envelope.
    Office,                       !- Zone Name  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    ,                             !- Space Name
    Outdoors,                     !- Outside Boundary Condition  Source: building.txt, Geometry.
    ,                             !- Outside Boundary Condition Object
    SunExposed,                   !- Sun Exposure  Not in the documents: follows from the outdoors.
    WindExposed,                  !- Wind Exposure  Not in the documents: follows from the outdoors.
    AutoCalculate,                !- View Factor to Ground  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus default.
    4,                            !- Number of Vertices  Source: building.txt, Geometry (a rectangle).
    0, 5, 3,                      !- Vertex 1  Source: building.txt, Geometry (5 m x 3 m).
    0, 5, 0,                      !- Vertex 2  Source: building.txt, Geometry (5 m x 3 m).
    0, 0, 0,                      !- Vertex 3  Source: building.txt, Geometry (5 m x 3 m).
    0, 0, 3;                      !- Vertex 4  Source: building.txt, Geometry (5 m x 3 m).

  Lights,
    Office Lights,                !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Office,                       !- Zone or ZoneList Name  Source: building.txt, Internal loads.
    Lights Schedule,              !- Schedule Name  Source: building.txt, Internal loads.
    Watts/Area,                   !- Design Level Calculation Method  Source: building.txt, Internal loads (W per m2).
    ,                             !- Lighting Level
    10,                           !- Watts per Zone Floor Area  Source: building.txt, Internal loads (10 W per m2).
    ,                             !- Watts per Person
    0,                            !- Return Air Fraction  Not in the documents: assumption.
    0.42,                         !- Fraction Radiant  Not in the documents: assumption.
    0.18;                         !- Fraction Visible  Not in the documents: assumption.

  ElectricEquipment,
    Office Equipment,             !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Office,                       !- Zone or ZoneList Name  Source: building.txt, Internal loads.
    Equipment Schedule,           !- Schedule Name  Source: building.txt, Internal loads.
    Watts/Area,                   !- Design Level Calculation Method  Source: building.txt, Internal loads (W per m2).
    ,                             !- Design Level
    8,                            !- Watts per Zone Floor Area  Source: building.txt, Internal loads (8 W per m2).
    ,                             !- Watts per Person
    0,                            !- Fraction Latent  Not in the documents: assumption.
    0.3,                          !- Fraction Radiant  Not in the documents: assumption.
    0;                            !- Fraction Lost  Not in the documents: assumption.

  Schedule:Constant,
    Always On,                    !- Name  Not in the documents: needed by the assumed infiltration.
    Fraction,                     !- Schedule Type Limits Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    1;                            !- Hourly Value  Not in the documents: needed by the assumed infiltration.

  ZoneInfiltration:DesignFlowRate,
    Office Infiltration,          !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Office,                       !- Zone or ZoneList Name  Not in the documents: follows from the assumed infiltration.
    Always On,                    !- Schedule Name  Not in the documents: assumption.
    AirChanges/Hour,              !- Design Flow Rate Calculation Method  Not in the documents: assumption.
    ,                             !- Design Flow Rate
    ,                             !- Flow Rate per Zone Floor Area
    ,                             !- Flow Rate per Exterior Surface Area
    0.3;                          !- Air Changes per Hour  Not in the documents: assumption.

  ThermostatSetpoint:DualSetpoint,
    Office Setpoints,             !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Heating Setpoint Schedule,    !- Heating Setpoint Temperature Schedule Name  Source: building.txt, Heating and cooling.
    Cooling Setpoint Schedule;    !- Cooling Setpoint Temperature Schedule Name  Source: building.txt, Heating and cooling.

  ZoneControl:Thermostat,
    Office Thermostat,            !- Name  Not in the documents: a name is needed.
    Office,                       !- Zone or ZoneList Name  Source: building.txt, Heating and cooling.
    Thermostat Control Type,      !- Control Type Schedule Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    ThermostatSetpoint:DualSetpoint, !- Control 1 Object Type  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    Office Setpoints;             !- Control 1 Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.

  ZoneHVAC:IdealLoadsAirSystem,
    Office Ideal Loads,           !- Name  Not in the documents: assumption (an ideal system stands for the HVAC).
    ,                             !- Availability Schedule Name
    Office Supply Node;           !- Zone Supply Air Node Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.

  ZoneHVAC:EquipmentList,
    Office Equipment List,        !- Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    SequentialLoad,               !- Load Distribution Scheme  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    ZoneHVAC:IdealLoadsAirSystem, !- Zone Equipment 1 Object Type  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    Office Ideal Loads,           !- Zone Equipment 1 Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    1,                            !- Zone Equipment 1 Cooling Sequence  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    1;                            !- Zone Equipment 1 Heating or No-Load Sequence  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.

  ZoneHVAC:EquipmentConnections,
    Office,                       !- Zone Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    Office Equipment List,        !- Zone Conditioning Equipment List Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    Office Supply Node,           !- Zone Air Inlet Node or NodeList Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    ,                             !- Zone Air Exhaust Node or NodeList Name
    Office Zone Node,             !- Zone Air Node Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
    Office Return Node;           !- Zone Return Air Node or NodeList Name  Not in the documents: EnergyPlus requires it.
